Warning [E2930]: this button has no accessible label
  --> tests/ui_lint/a11y_unlabeled_control.jet:4:16
    |
  4 |     node :: ui.node_role("", 40.0, 10.0, ui.aria_role_button())
    |                ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Screen readers announce a control by its accessible label; an empty label is invisible to assistive tech.
 Fix: Pass a real label, e.g. `ui.node_role("Submit", w, h, ui.aria_role_button())`.
